{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QuantumObservableUniverses.ContactAffineChart","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QuantumObservableUniverses.ContactAffineChart","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:QOU.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Polynomial.Laurent","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Field.Basic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Int.Basic"],"declarations":12,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.deep_quantum_limit","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.deep_quantum_limit","kind":"theorem","line":71,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L71-L84","doc":"The deep-quantum limit: `|Z|` is small when the Reeb contraction is\nlarge relative to the horizontal component (the archimedean image\n`R = ℝ` of the substrate, after the fibre functor). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.affineCoord_welldefined","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.affineCoord_welldefined","kind":"theorem","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L64-L69","doc":"The affine coordinate is well-defined (denominator nonzero). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.affineCoord","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.affineCoord","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L58-L62","doc":"The affine coordinate Z = α_H / ι_ξ α on the contact chart. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.reeb_nonzero","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.reeb_nonzero","kind":"theorem","line":56,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L56-L56","doc":"Non-vanishing condition: ι_ξ α ≠ 0. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.reeb_contraction","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.reeb_contraction","kind":"def","line":54,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L54-L54","doc":"The Reeb contraction ι_ξ α (non-vanishing on U_ξ). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.horizontal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.horizontal","kind":"def","line":52,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L52-L52","doc":"The horizontal component α_H. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.point","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.point","kind":"def","line":50,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L50-L50","doc":"The base manifold point. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart.mk","kind":"ctor","line":48,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L48-L48","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ContactAffineChart","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ContactAffineChart","kind":"structure","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L40-L56","doc":"**Contact affine chart**: the open dense subset of P(V) where the\nReeb contraction is non-vanishing.\n\nOn U_ξ, the affine coordinate Z = α_H / ι_ξ α provides a\nstereographic projection for the projective line fibres. The\ncoordinate components take values in a field `R` (the archimedean\nimage of `R_q` under the fibre functor), so the quotient is defined. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:def:contact-affine-chart","label":"def:contact-affine-chart","md":"quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_inv_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_inv_param","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L37-L38","doc":"Its inverse `q⁻¹ ∈ R_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.q_param","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.q_param","kind":"def","line":34,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L34-L35","doc":"The canonical indeterminate `q ∈ R_q`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.R_q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.R_q","kind":"def","line":30,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/contact-affine-chart.lean#L30-L32","doc":"Ground ring `R_q = ℤ[q, q⁻¹]` (Laurent polynomials over ℤ).\nSee `QOU.Archimedean.GroundRing` for the compiled definition. ","signatureChunk":0}]}